       erofs - the Enhanced Read‐Only File System

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       eerrooffss  is a create‐once read‐only filesystem, with support for compres‐
       sion and a multi‐device backing store.

       There are two inode formats:

       •  32‐byte compact with 16‐bit UID/GID, 32‐bit file size, and  no  file
          times
       •  64‐byte  extended with 32‐bit UID/GID, 64‐bit file size, and a modi‐
          fication time (_s_t___m_t_i_m).

